## Task naming (mandatory — Events + all SAN work)

```text
SAN-### · SPEC-ID — <full Linear title>
```

Example: **SAN-731 · UI-004 — Event detail loading skeleton + hero alt (a11y)**

Never SAN-only, spec-only, or abbreviated titles in execution lists, PRs, commits, or chat. Events detail: [`tasks/events/notes/1-notes.md`](../../../tasks/events/notes/1-notes.md).

---

## Workflow (every task)

| Step | When | Action |
|------|------|--------|
| **1. Name** | Always | Full `SAN-### · SPEC-ID — title` in branch, PR, Linear, notes |
| **2. Before code** | Start | **Pre-verify** ([`mdeai-events-pre-impl-verify.mdc`](./mdeai-events-pre-impl-verify.mdc)): skills + MCP + task-verifier → update `todo.md` readiness + failure points; **no code if readiness &lt; 70** |
| **3. After code** | Pre-PR | Vitest → Playwright → **real-world browser** (localhost screenshot) → evidence MD — see [`mdeai-real-world-proof-pr-review.mdc`](./mdeai-real-world-proof-pr-review.mdc) |
| **4. Before PR** | PR open | Local **`cr review --agent --base main`** + **`cubic review --base main`**; fix Critical/Warning |
| **5. Before merge** | PR ready | cubic + CodeRabbit **PR threads resolved**; re-run browser if UI changed; `npm run floor` / CI green |
| **6. Linear** | Ship | **In Review** + evidence link; **Done** only after user approval |

One issue = one branch = one PR (`Closes SAN-###`).

---

## Verification stack (order)

```text
Skills + MCP docs  →  implement  →  unit/Playwright
  →  REAL-WORLD BROWSER (mandatory): Playwright and/or Cursor Browser MCP
      → localhost:3001 screenshot + console clean
      → Chrome DevTools MCP if failures (network/console)
      → https://www.mdeai.co/ or https://mdeai.co/ before merge
  →  LOCAL cr review + cubic review (pre-PR)
  →  evidence file  →  open PR
  →  resolve cubic + CodeRabbit PR threads  →  merge
  →  changelog (Events)  →  Linear In Review
```

Full spec: [`mdeai-real-world-proof-pr-review.mdc`](./mdeai-real-world-proof-pr-review.mdc)

**Anti-fake-done:** Memory and Linear `status:` are not evidence. Re-probe disk + runtime.

