Path: `tasks/testing/evidence/YYYY-MM-DD/SAN-###-<slug>-RESULTS.md`

```markdown
# SAN-### · SPEC-ID — <full Linear title>

| Check | localhost | prod |
|-------|-----------|------|
| curl GET / | | |
| targeted vitest | | |
| Playwright | | |
| Real-world browser (localhost) | PASS + screenshot path | PASS/BLOCKED + screenshot path |
| Console / network | clean | clean |
| Playwright | PASS/FAIL | — |
| cubic (local + PR) | PASS — threads resolved | |
| CodeRabbit (local + PR) | PASS — threads resolved | |
| floor | PASS/FAIL | |

Commits: <sha> · PR: #NNN
Screenshot: tasks/testing/evidence/YYYY-MM-DD/SAN-###.png
```

Required for persona-visible UI/agent changes before In Review.

