## PR merge checklist

- [ ] **Real-world proof** — localhost browser screenshot in evidence ([`mdeai-real-world-proof-pr-review.mdc`](./mdeai-real-world-proof-pr-review.mdc))
- [ ] **Pre-PR bots** — `cr review --agent --base main` + `cubic review --base main` run
- [ ] Scope = one `SAN-*` issue; full title in PR body
- [ ] cubic + CodeRabbit **PR threads resolved** (or wont-fix in evidence)
- [ ] floor / Vercel green
- [ ] Evidence path in PR comment (and changelog if Events)
- [ ] Prod browser/curl after deploy for ship claims
- [ ] Linear **In Review** — not Done until user approves
